menu "Ambyte USB service benchmark"

config AMBYTE_SVC_BENCH
    bool "Enable the volatile USB checksum-sink benchmark"
    default n
    help
        Bench-only transport measurements (PlatformIO env svc-bench). Enables
        volatile ingress and egress up to 1 MiB without storing payloads or
        touching capture, SD, firmware or credentials. Never ship in a release.

endmenu
